{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Best Thief</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fun, competitive game, you\u2019ll become a daring thief ready to do anything for the ultimate score. With valuables under tight guard, time running out, and rivals scheming against you, show the city who\u2019s the greatest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/fb97f6f3a92daed2ede4780bffb96d13.poster.avif?t=1757183266\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/fb97f6f3a92daed2ede4780bffb96d13.webm?t=1757183266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Many Modes, Endless Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into heists and game modes galore. Master every challenge or escape the chaos with your head held high\u2014if you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/4c6c855e84cf58911be01b831034a9d8.poster.avif?t=1757183266\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/4c6c855e84cf58911be01b831034a9d8.webm?t=1757183266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stealing is a Blast</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends or strangers: push, shoot, explode, sabotage, destroy, and hide. Rack up points to claim the champion\u2019s crown, but remember\u2014it\u2019s the chaos along the way that counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/685b692c0d643634e57d67a41e8a20a7.poster.avif?t=1757183266\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/685b692c0d643634e57d67a41e8a20a7.webm?t=1757183266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style is Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who says thieves need masks and black outfits? Pull off heists in a koala suit, alien gear, coconut shell\u2026 or just a paper bag. This city\u2019s never seen style like yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/07aea8a726f248131bf2638ffde8a1fe.poster.avif?t=1757183266\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/07aea8a726f248131bf2638ffde8a1fe.webm?t=1757183266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go Solo or Team Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a dream team of four or fly solo. Pull off brilliant (or hilariously messy) heists to dominate the thieves\u2019 championship and climb the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/7d0ccba5af0692a5561edee4bbe68c01.poster.avif?t=1757183266\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/extras/7d0ccba5af0692a5561edee4bbe68c01.webm?t=1757183266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cEvents in this game are 100% authentic. That\u2019s how I operate.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2013 Self-proclaimed \u201cWorld\u2019s Greatest Thief\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe best game ever! My son plays it non-stop!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2013 Mom of one of the devs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cPlease stop poking the round trap. Seriously.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2013 A tired tester</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698900?t=1757183266","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698900?t=1757183266","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/6ab372452effa1d39d3baea78be6b0d96265d5ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757183266","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698900/6ab372452effa1d39d3baea78be6b0d96265d5ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757183266","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Best Thief</strong></h2><